OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hit car to stop it going
OL,4,Awrong way on A1(M)
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers had to ram a fleeing
OL,7,Fcar to stop the "catastrophic
OL,8,Fconsequences" of it driving the wrong
OL,9,Fway down a motorway, a court has heard.
OL,11,FBanned driver Matthew Cannings-Kent,
OL,12,F27, reached speeds of 70mph in a 30mph
OL,13,Fzone before trying to join the A1(M) at
OL,14,FDarlington in the wrong direction in a
OL,15,Fbid to escape pursuing police, Teesside
OL,16,FCrown Court heard.
OL,18,FCannings-Kent admitted dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving and driving while disqualified
OL,20,Fand with no insurance. He was found
OL,21,Fguilty of going equipped for theft.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
